      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Leonardo painted the portrait in Florence between 1474 and 1478, possibly to commemorate Ginevra's marriage to Luigi di Bernardo Niccolini at the age of 16.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Ginevra de' Benci",
