          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "He made a portrait of Ginevra d' Amerigo Benci, a very beautiful work",
        "source": {
          "author": "Giorgio Vasari",
          "title": "Lives of the Most Eminent Painters, Sculptors and Architects, Vol. 4 (Life of Leonardo da Vinci)",
